              Extract <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg2.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg2.l4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}_{\text{help}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mtext>help</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}_{\text{help}}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg2.l4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}_{\text{safety}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mtext>safety</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}_{\text{safety}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l4.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Extract intention hidden prompt, responses, and scores
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathcal{K}\leftarrow\{\mathcal{R}[i]:\{h:\mathcal{S}_{\text{help}}[i],s:\mathcal{S}_{\text{safety}}[i]\}\mid i=0,\dots,|\mathcal{R}|-1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒦</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo rspace="0.278em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mtext>help</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mtext>safety</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{K}\leftarrow\{\mathcal{R}[i]:\{h:\mathcal{S}_{\text{help}}[i],s:\mathcal{S}_{\text{safety}}[i]\}\mid i=0,\dots,|\mathcal{R}|-1\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{\text{help}}\leftarrow\sigma(\mathcal{S}_{\text{help}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>help</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mtext>help</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{\text{help}}\leftarrow\sigma(\mathcal{S}_{\text{help}})</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg2.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{\text{safety}}\leftarrow\sigma(\mathcal{S}_{\text{safety}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>safety</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mtext>safety</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{\text{safety}}\leftarrow\sigma(\mathcal{S}_{\text{safety}})</annotation></semantics></math>

