<section id="Ax1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Dataset Details</h3>

<section id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Attack Seed Dataset (<math id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{A}^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{A}^{0}</annotation></semantics></math>)</h5>

<div id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use the same attack dataset as <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">Jiang et al. (2025)</a></cite>, collected from multiple sources: AART <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">Radharapu et al. (2023)</a></cite>, DNA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib37" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wang et al. (2024b)</a></cite>, HARMFULQA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Bhardwaj and Poria (2023)</a></cite>, DangerousQA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Bhardwaj and Poria (2023)</a></cite>, STP <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib29" title="" class="ltx_ref">Revilla Llaca et al. (2023)</a></cite>, Beavertails <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ji et al. (2023)</a></cite> and AEGIS2.0 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ghosh et al. (2025)</a></cite>. The dataset contains 12,400 prompts categorized into 14 categories according to OpenAI’s usage guidelines<span id="footnote7" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">7</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">7</sup>
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">7</span>
                
                
                
              https://openai.com/policies/usage-policies</span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Expanding Seed Dataset (<math id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}^{0}</annotation></semantics></math>)</h5>

<div id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This dataset consists of 10,000 sentence pairs used for prompt expansion, following the experimental setting of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">Jiang et al. (2025)</a></cite>. No additional expanding data was collected during progressive training.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Intention Hiding Seed Dataset (<math id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}^{0}</annotation></semantics></math>)</h5>

<div id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Contains 300 instruction-output pairs where outputs are designed to hide the intention of the input. These were manually obfuscated samples from <math id="Ax1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{A}^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{A}^{0}</annotation></semantics></math> that successfully bypassed GPT-4o-mini defenses<span id="footnote8" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">8</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">8</sup>
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">8</span>
                
                
                
              https://openai.com</span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
