<div id="Ax1.SS8.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.SS8.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#Ax1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Safety Evaluation ‣ A.8 Manual Evaluation Results ‣ Appendix ‣ Can Safety Emerge from Weak Supervision? A Systematic Analysis of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> shows the average safety scores, where higher values indicate better safety performance.</p>
